|~ The verbs of docs [D94]. Each resides on `::qlang/doc`, the kind
   whose module declares it [D72]; a doc is also the vector of its
   segments, so the verbs of vectors read it as one. ~|

:join
  |~~ The text of the doc: its prose with each quote written where it
      stands.

      ~(|~~ a ~(add 1) b ~~| | join | eq " a ~(add 1) b ")
      ~(::vec/join | docs | first | join | contains "separator")
  ~~|
  ::verb~(:returns ::string | ::builtin{:impl :qlang/prim/docText})
